              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bano nibo abatikulukha nibarula eTeli-mela, naTeliharisha, naKherubu, naAdani, naImeri, nibakhaywa okhwibaala ebilibwa biabwe kata olwibulo lwabwe, nibaba nibali abaIsiraeli nohomba ",
