          "text": "khandi nende abakholi babwe beshisaatsa nabeshikhasinabo bali ebikhumila musaafu ebikhumi bitaru amakhumi kataru namusaafu; khandi bali nende abeembi beshisaatsa nabeshikhasi ebikhumi bibili. ",
