              "text": "69",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bahaana shinga olwa banyala mwibiishilo liemilimo echio, tsidarikoni ebikhumila amakhumi kasasaba nashilala etsieitsahaabu, tsimina ebikhumila biraano etsieifeetsa, nebiifwalo biabakuhani eshikhumi.",
